  "content": "<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n  \n<img alt=\"Exposure\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/main.png\" width=225/>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n### 胶片摄影模组\n\n<br>\n<br>\n\n<img alt=\"相机\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_camera.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"胶片\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_film.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"冲洗\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_developing.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"晒印\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_printing.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"照片\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_photograph.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"附加功能\" width=\"260\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_additional_features.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"色差\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_chromatic.png\"/>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"跨位面投影仪\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_projector.gif\"/>\n<br><br>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/exposure-polaroid\"><img alt=\"拍立得\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_polaroid.png\"/></a>\n<br><br>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/exposure-catalog\"><img alt=\"相册\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_catalog.png\"/></a>\n<br><br>\n<img alt=\"底片\" width=\"1000\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_negatives.png\"/>\n\n</div>\n\n<br>\n\n<details>\n  \n<summary>文字版说明</summary>\n<h3>相机</h3>\n\n- 操作相机很简单：装入一卷胶卷，打开取景器，构图并按下快门。<br>\n- 在取景器视角中按住潜行键可调整相机设置：焦距、快门速度、闪光灯模式、构图辅助线。<br>\n- 潜行时使用相机可打开配件窗口，您将能够：\n    - 装入胶卷\n    - 装备闪光灯（红石灯）\n    - 改装镜头（望远镜）\n    - 安装滤镜（玻璃板）\n\n<h3>胶卷</h3>\n\n- 要拍摄图像，您需要使用感光胶片。\n- 您可以使用简单的黑白胶卷，或更复杂、制作和处理难度更高的彩色胶卷。\n- 单卷胶卷可容纳 16 张底片。\n- 晒印前需要对胶卷进行显影处理。\n\n<h3>暗房</h3>\n\n- 照片通过暗房方块进行晒印。\n- 晒印前可预览底片图像，帮助您选择最佳曝光。\n- 黑白照片需要纸和黑色染料。\n- 彩色照片在此基础上还需青、品红、黄三种染料。\n\n<h3>照片</h3>\n\n最后，您将获得照片——捕捉时光的瞬间！\n现在，您可以欣赏成果，将其挂在墙上，与朋友分享，甚至卖给《国家地理》。无限可能，尽在其中。\n\n</details>\n\n<iframe width=\"1000\" height=\"350\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/HI9Bnjc9HYs\" title=\"YouTube 这个模组在《我的世界》中添加了摄影功能！\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n<br><br>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n<h1><a href=\"https://moddedmc.wiki/en/project/exposure/latest/docs\">Wiki 百科</a></h1>\n\n__已知不兼容：__\n\n</div>\n\n- Optifine - 已知会导致其他模组出现问题。建议改用 Sodium/Embeddium。\n- Visual Overhaul - 打开相机控制时崩溃 - [GitHub 问题页面](https://github.com/mortuusars/Exposure/issues/19)\n- Exordium - 通过取景器时出现问题和闪烁。\n- FastAnim（Fabric版）- 使用相机时破坏玩家模型动画。[GitHub 问题页面](https://github.com/mortuusars/Exposure/issues/71)\n\n<h1> </h1>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n\n#### 喜欢这个模组吗？您的支持将让我继续开发它及其他模组！\n[<img alt=\"Patreon\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/patreon_seamless.png\" width=558.73/>](https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars/membership)[<img alt=\"PayPal\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/paypal_seamless.png\" width=191.75/>](https://www.paypal.com/donate/?hosted_button_id=4VPMCBCLZVUEA)\n[<img alt=\"金色相机\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/exposure/page_golden_camera.png\" width=1000/>](https://www.patreon.com/mortuusars/posts/rewards-129739244)\n\n<h1> </h1>\n\n[<img alt=\"Discord 服务器\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/mortuusars/resources/main/media/banners/discord.png\" width=500/>](https://discord.gg/FzHKGDW2et)\n\n</div>",
